      {
        "id": "ai-node-38",
        "name": "Connect AI guide",
        "type": "text",
        "x": 7700,
        "y": 5570,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 80,
        "socketArray": [
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Content",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"StringType\"}",
            "data": "**Make a quiz** sends the document's text to an AI model. You can connect one in two ways.\n**Signed in to Tailrmade:** nothing to set up. Requests go through Tailrmade's cloud, within a daily allowance.\n**Your own API key, through the Companion:** uses your own provider account, and works without signing in.\n1. Install [Tailrmade Companion](https://github.com/PlugAndPlayground/pnp-companion-2/releases) and start it. It runs in the menu bar or the system tray.\n2. Open its **Settings** and add your key as **ANTHROPIC\\_API\\_KEY**, **GEMINI\\_API\\_KEY** or **OPENAI\\_API\\_KEY**. The key is kept in your system keychain and only sent to that provider.\n3. If you are signed in, open the **AI assistant**, then **Settings**, and set **Run AI assistant** to **Local companion**. AI nodes follow that setting. Signed out, AI always goes through the Companion.\n4. Pick the matching provider above and press **Make a quiz** again.\n[Keys are never saved in the app file, so you can share an app that uses AI without sharing your key.]{.muted}",
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Variant",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"EnumType\",\"type\":{\"options\":[{\"text\":\"display\",\"value\":\"display\"},{\"text\":\"h1\",\"value\":\"h1\"},{\"text\":\"h2\",\"value\":\"h2\"},{\"text\":\"h3\",\"value\":\"h3\"},{\"text\":\"body\",\"value\":\"body\"},{\"text\":\"caption\",\"value\":\"caption\"},{\"text\":\"label\",\"value\":\"label\"},{\"text\":\"stat\",\"value\":\"stat\"}],\"showAsButtons\":false}}",
            "data": "body",
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Tone",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"EnumType\",\"type\":{\"options\":[{\"text\":\"default\",\"value\":\"default\"},{\"text\":\"muted\",\"value\":\"muted\"},{\"text\":\"primary\",\"value\":\"primary\"},{\"text\":\"secondary\",\"value\":\"secondary\"},{\"text\":\"success\",\"value\":\"success\"},{\"text\":\"warning\",\"value\":\"warning\"},{\"text\":\"error\",\"value\":\"error\"}],\"showAsButtons\":false}}",
            "data": "default",
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Alignment",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"EnumType\",\"type\":{\"options\":[{\"text\":\"left\",\"value\":\"left\"},{\"text\":\"center\",\"value\":\"center\"},{\"text\":\"right\",\"value\":\"right\"},{\"text\":\"justify\",\"value\":\"justify\"}],\"showAsButtons\":false}}",
            "data": "left",
            "visible": false
